    "body": "Escalated from effort:medium to effort:high under the AGENTS.md safety floor.\n\nThe stream writer in crates/post/src/post/mod.rs treats a move with no axis as keeping the modal pose. The Tormach indexFor function starts a section at A0 when its first motion has no A word. Picking one meaning can change posted rotary motion. This needs the high effort safety review.\n\nPR #2490 added the within-section refusal, but upstream/main 2f965f7d9 still has the section-start mismatch. Existing tormach_no_a_word tests cover rapid and linear records, not the requested arc, cycle and probe messages.\n\nNo claim was taken. No code, tests, branch or worktree were changed. The issue remains free for a high effort worker.\n",
